{"unit_id":"yixin2021__dsh-skills#card-zh","repo":"yixin2021/dsh-skills","commit":"3b7c9850c156b0c1f7d184667f5dcc38dff5a56e","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-skills 是 DSH Web 端的 Agent Skills 管理面板，在左侧导航提供技能目录入口。它通过主机路由读取技能根目录，并把已发现的技能提供给 DSH 模型；用户可以查看技能说明和完整指令、启用或停用技能、创建技能、从本地文件夹安装，或从 GitHub 等 Git 仓库导入一个或多个技能，也可恢复已移入回收区的内容。面板还支持管理其他 Agent 的技能库和自定义目录。适合需要集中整理、预览和切换 DSH 技能的用户；本地目录操作无需额外账号，非 GitHub 仓库导入需要 git。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:1913-1917","index.js:1000-1048","index.js:1063-1088"]}
{"unit_id":"yixin2021__dsh-skills#card-en","repo":"yixin2021/dsh-skills","commit":"3b7c9850c156b0c1f7d184667f5dcc38dff5a56e","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-skills adds a skill manager to the DSH web sidebar. It lists and previews skills, toggles them, creates skills, installs folders, imports repository bundles, and restores trashed entries. It also manages other agent libraries. Local use needs no account; non-GitHub imports need git.","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:1913-1917","index.js:1000-1048","index.js:1063-1088"]}
